## Story Description
Four fixes to the Recommendations page: (1) make Total Identified Savings the hero number; (2) add a colour legend to the priority matrix; (3) move the confidence filter buttons to sit directly above the recommendation cards section; (4) replace the inconsistent Sanity Check badge with a proper KpiCard.

## Acceptance Criteria
- Edit file: frontend/src/pages/dashboard/RecommendationsPage.tsx
- Hero number: above the 4-card KPI grid, add a div className='text-center py-4 border rounded-xl bg-card shadow-sm': inside render <p className='text-xs text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wide mb-1'>Total Identified Savings</p> and <p className='text-5xl font-bold text-green-700'>{formatCurrency(portfolio?.total_identified_savings ?? 0)}</p>. Only render this div when portfolio is defined.
- Replace the 4th KPI card (the Sanity Check div) with a proper KpiCard: <KpiCard label='Sanity Check' value={portfolio?.sanity_check_passed ? 'Passed' : 'Review'} valueType='text' accentColor={portfolio?.sanity_check_passed ? 'green' : 'risk'} />
